# the sole owner of every path; this expands as co-maintainers are
# formally onboarded (see AUTHORS.md for the current team-structure context).
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Catch-all — the maintainer owns everything until co-maintainers are
# named and have accepted the responsibility.
*       @maksodf

